  "name": "Alola Collection",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "Two boxes, the first product of the Sun & Moon TCG Series, sold early at Target in North America from 13 November 2016, more widely from 18 November and in Europe from 23 November, with the Sun and Moon games. Each featured Solgaleo or Lunala and held the three Alola first partners, some as promos and some as water web holofoil copies from the coming Sun & Moon set, found in no booster pack. The Solgaleo version held foil Rowlet and Popplio, promo Litten SM02 and a jumbo Solgaleo-GX; the Lunala version a foil Litten, promos Rowlet SM01 and Popplio SM03 and a jumbo Lunala-GX. The jumbos lack the HP, Evolution Stage and attack costs of the expansion's cards. North American boxes added a pin, a figure and five booster packs; European ones a first partner pin and three booster packs.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon: Alola Collection",
        "url": "https://www.pokemon.com/us/pokemon-tcg/product-gallery/alola-collection"
      },
